# ── TaxaWizard transient state ──────────────────
# Generated filenames are always taxaid_workflow_YYYYMMDD.R / taxaid_methods_YYYYMMDD.md
# (TaxaWizard/R/output.R). Anchored on a leading digit after the underscore so this
# doesn't also match hand-maintained templates like inst/TaxaID_Workflow_Template_TEST.R
# on case-insensitive filesystems (core.ignorecase=true) -- confirmed via
# `git check-ignore` that the old unanchored *.R glob did exactly that.
.workflow_checkpoints/
taxaid_workflow_[0-9]*.R
taxaid_methods_[0-9]*.md
*/taxaid_workflow_[0-9]*.R
*/taxaid_methods_[0-9]*.md

# ── Claude Code local settings ──────────────────
.claude/

# ── One-off scripts with hardcoded user paths ───
TaxaAssign/inst/demo_for_JV.R
TaxaAssign/inst/Wrapper_full_workflow.R
TaxaMatch/inst/Write_text_reports.R

# ── PDF data files in TaxaFetch (large) ─────────
TaxaFetch/pdfs/

# ── Reference audio and classifier output (large; regenerable) ──
reference_audio/
**/reference_audio/
birdnet_results/
**/birdnet_results/

